<template><section class="ai-settings"><div class="view-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">AI SETTINGS</span><h2>模型与提示词</h2><p>集中管理模型连接与分析规则，保存后立即用于下次分析。</p></div><label class="toggle"><input v-model="model.enabled" type="checkbox" />启用AI分析</label></div><div class="model-grid"><label>模型名称<input v-model="model.model" placeholder="例如 gpt-4o-mini" /></label><label>API地址<input v-model="model.baseUrl" placeholder="https://.../v1" /></label><label>API Key<input v-model="model.apiKey" type="password" placeholder="输入新 Key 替换，清空后保存会移除" /></label><label>AI请求并发数（服务端上限5）<input v-model.number="model.maxConcurrentRequests" type="number" min="1" max="5" /></label><label>默认周期<select v-model="strategy.interval"><option>1m</option><option>5m</option><option>15m</option><option>1h</option><option>4h</option><option>1d</option></select></label><label>默认K线数量<input v-model.number="strategy.klineLimit" type="number" min="20" max="200" /></label></div><label class="prompt-label">系统提示词<textarea v-model="strategy.systemPrompt" rows="4" /></label><label class="prompt-label">分析规则<textarea v-model="strategy.rules" rows="5" /></label><button class="secondary" @click="$emit('save')" :disabled="loading">保存AI配置</button></section></template>
